			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				61.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				109.1
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥανίδα</span> codd.), <i><span class="en">
